  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nEverything we encounter and choose to focus on each day is filled with love, whether it's the sky, trees, flowers, or the people we love. This recipe is based on my perspective, where I enjoy vibrant tones in images. I recommend using it on sunny days with photos featuring the blue of the sky, the green of nature, and the magenta and yellow of flowers. You'll get bright, lively images that never get boring. For optimal results, I recommend using the 'Active D-Lighting Extra High'. This will help you create bright, lively images that never fail to captivate.",
